{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109120130375-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109130749\"/><p>今晚氣溫將進一步下降，明早風勢仍然頗大。</p><p>天文台在今日（9日）上午11時52分發出特別天氣提示，指受強烈東北季候風影響，預料本港今晚氣溫將進一步下降，明早（10日）風勢仍然頗大，天氣顯著轉涼，最低氣溫在攝氏16度左右。本周三(11日)早上新界仍然清涼，日夜溫差頗大。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.535453+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:40.314708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:44.050725+00:00","content_hash":"df6e192ad0a88b7d38b68281796f7ae4cc7a1f901bf8d5fc719cb51961eaa750","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}